        "usage": {
          "input_tokens": 593,
          "output_tokens": 0
        }
      },
      "text": "We build and repair city bikes in Vienna. Every bike is assembled by hand in our workshop and road-tested before it leaves the shop. Our mechanics service all major brands, and most repairs are done within two working days. Orders over fifty euros ship free."
    },
